{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"13":"Divorce (Kitab Al-Talaq)"},"section_detail":{"13":{"hadithnumber_first":2175,"hadithnumber_last":2312,"arabicnumber_first":2175,"arabicnumber_last":2312,"name_native":"كتاب الطلاق"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2177,"arabicnumber":2177,"text":"حدثنا احمد بن يونس، حدثنا معرف، عن محارب، قال قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم \" ما احل الله شييا ابغض اليه من الطلاق","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":13,"hadith":3}}]}